     [0,1].  To make use of this function, write first
     ‘load("distrib")’.


File: maxima-core-docs.info,  Node: Function quantile_normal q m s,  Next: Function quantile_pareto q a b,  Prev: Function quantile_noncentral_student_t q n ncp,  Up: distrib

