 -- Function: std_weibull (A, B)
     Returns the standard deviation of a {\it Weibull}(a,b) random
     variable, with a,b>0.  To make use of this function, write first
     ‘load("distrib")’.

     The variance is

     D[X] = b\sqrt{\Gamma\left(1+{2\over a}\right) -
     \Gamma\left(1+{1\over a}\right)^2}


