 -- Function: var_bernoulli (P)
     Returns the variance of a {\it Bernoulli}(p) random variable, with
     0 \leq p \leq 1.

     The {\it Bernoulli}(p) random variable is equivalent to the {\it
     Binomial}(1,p) .

     The variance is

     V[X] = p(1-p)

     (%i1) load ("distrib")$
     
     (%i2) var_bernoulli(p);
     (%o2)                       (1 - p) p


